    is a small text file stored on your computer or mobile device when you visit
    a website or use an app. Cookies typically contain a unique identifier that helps
    recognize your device and may store user preferences or other data.\r\n\r\nWe
    use cookies for the following purposes:\r\n\r\nEssential Cookies \u2013 Required
    for app functionality and security.\r\n\r\nAnalytics Cookies \u2013 Help us track
